;; Verified public-register citations for the legal entity archived by this repository.
;;
;; Every row is checked live by tools/verify_citations.cljs:
;;   * GET :cite/url must answer HTTP 2xx
;;   * :cite/expect-substring must appear in the response body
;;
;; A URL that cannot be fetched, or whose body no longer carries the claim, is a
;; DRIFT and fails the gate. Nothing is recorded here that was not retrieved
;; (all rows were fetched and byte-matched on 2026-08-22).
;;
;; FOUR independent voices are cited, not one:
;;   * GLEIF, the global LEI system (api.gleif.org) -- including its resolution
;;     of registration authority RA000412 (the Legal Affairs Bureau / 法務局,
;;     Japan's commercial register), of entity legal form T417 (株式会社,
;;     kabusiki gaisya), and of the managing LOU -- which for this record is
;;     株式会社東京証券取引所, Tokyo Stock Exchange, Inc. itself
;;   * the National Tax Agency (国税庁), at its Corporate Number Publication
;;     Site (houjin-bangou.nta.go.jp) -- the state's own per-entity page for
;;     corporate number 6010401020516, which also carries change history the
;;     other voices do not have (four absorbed subsidiaries, cited below)
;;   * gBizINFO (info.gbiz.go.jp), the Ministry of Economy, Trade and
;;     Industry's cross-ministry corporate-information aggregator, printing the
;;     same name, number, and head-office address from a separately operated
;;     service
;;   * the issuer itself, at www.tokyo-gas.co.jp -- the privacy-policy page
;;     this repository archives (80-data/public/tos.journal.edn archives
;;     https://www.tokyo-gas.co.jp/utility/privacy/index.html, the same URL row
;;     issuer-privacy-title cites) and its own company-profile page
;;
;; HOW THE TWO REGISTRY NUMBERS RELATE (so a reader does not count one voice
;; twice). GLEIF names RA000412 -- Companies Registration (登記) operated by
;; the Legal Affairs Bureau (法務局) -- as both register of record and
;; validation authority, and records registeredAs 0104-01-020516, the
;; 会社法人等番号 (company registration number) in the registry's own
;; XXXX-XX-XXXXXX rendering. The National Tax Agency's 法人番号 (corporate
;; number) 6010401020516 is, by the NTA's published construction, a single
;; check digit (6) prefixed to those same 12 digits with the hyphens removed
;; (010401020516). So rows gleif-registered-as / gleif-validated-as /
;; gleif-ocid and rows nta-corporate-number / gbiz-corporate-number corroborate
;; one underlying commercial-registry identity through two different state
;; renderings of it -- and GLEIF's OpenCorporates id jp/6010401020516 prints
;; the NTA-form number inside the GLEIF body itself.
;;
;; FIVE HONEST WRINKLES, SO A READER DOES NOT MISREAD THEM AS DRIFT:
;;   1. GLEIF's creationDate "1885-09-30T15:00:00Z" (row gleif-creation-date)
;;      and the issuer's founding date 明治18（1885）年10月1日 (row
;;      issuer-profile-founded) are the SAME instant -- UTC rendering of Tokyo
;;      midnight, JST being UTC+9. Not a disagreement.
;;   2. The registered legal name is 東京瓦斯株式会社 -- with 瓦斯, the kanji
;;      rendering of "gas" -- and that is what GLEIF (row gleif-legal-name-ja,
;;      as \u escapes in the raw JSON), the NTA (row nta-legal-name), gBizINFO
;;      (row gbiz-legal-name), and the issuer's own company-profile page (row
;;      issuer-profile-legal-name) all print. But the issuer's consumer portal
;;      brands itself 東京ガス株式会社 in katakana (row issuer-privacy-brand,
;;      on the very privacy-policy page this repository archives). Same
;;      company, marketing rendering vs registered rendering.
;;   3. The head-office address arrives in three renderings that are one
;;      place: GLEIF ja 海岸一丁目５番２０号 (kanji chōme, full-width digits;
;;      row gleif-legal-address), NTA/gBizINFO 東京都港区海岸１丁目５番２０号
;;      (full-width digit chōme; rows nta-head-office, gbiz-head-office), and
;;      the issuer's 港区海岸1-5-20 (half-width; row issuer-profile-address).
;;      GLEIF's English alternative address 1-5-20,Kaigan (row
;;      gleif-legal-address-en) and postal code 105-8527 tie them together.
;;   4. The GLEIF JSON body serves non-ASCII as literal \uXXXX escapes, so the
;;      Japanese-text GLEIF rows below match those escape sequences (written in
;;      this EDN with doubled backslashes), while the NTA / gBizINFO / issuer
;;      pages serve raw UTF-8 and their rows match the characters directly.
;;      Two encodings, one legal name.
;;   5. The four nta-merger-* rows cite absorbed subsidiaries (ティージー
;;      グローバルトレーディング, ティージープラス, 東京ガスリブソリュー
;;      ションズ, スミレナ) from the NTA page's change-history section. They
;;      are DIFFERENT legal entities (each with its own corporate number,
;;      printed in the rows) that merged INTO this one -- cited as the NTA's
;;      unique voice on this entity's history, not as claims about its current
;;      identity.
;;
;; WHY THERE IS NO LISTING-VENUE ROW FOR TICKER 9531. The Tokyo Stock
;; Exchange's per-issue quote page answers 404 to this gate (see
;; :catalog/unreachable, measured 2026-08-22), and the issuer's own IR stock
;; page renders its 証券コード client-side, so the server body this gate
;; fetches does not carry "9531" to match. The venue connection that CAN be
;; verified live is stronger than a quote page: GLEIF's managing LOU for this
;; very record is 株式会社東京証券取引所, Tokyo Stock Exchange, Inc. (rows
;; gleif-managing-lou, lou-legal-name-en, lou-lei) -- the exchange operator is
;; the LEI issuer of record for the company. The ticker claim in README.md
;; ("9531 (TSE Prime)") therefore rests on the README, not on a row below;
;; nothing below asserts it.

